<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Hi there and welcome, especially if you&rsquo;re new around here!</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">This post is a little different from my usual recipe content. Every now and then, I like to share a peek behind the scenes; what&rsquo;s been going on in life, business, and everything in between.&nbsp;</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">It&rsquo;s part reflection, part catch-up, and part just me being real with you.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">If you&rsquo;re curious about what&rsquo;s been happening lately and want a break from the kitchen, I think you&rsquo;ll enjoy this one.</p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-we-moved">We Moved! &#129535;</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">If you follow me <a href="https://www.instagram.com/foolproofliving/" rel="nofollow">on Instagram</a>, you&rsquo;ve probably seen bits and pieces of our recent move.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">For a long time, I thought our last house was going to be our forever home. But when Dwight got a new job in the city, we had to take a hard look at his commute. Spending over an hour each way in Atlanta traffic, especially with his long workdays, just wasn&rsquo;t sustainable.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image aligncenter size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="1800" data-pin-nopin="true" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/IMG_2498.jpg" alt="Dwight and Aysegul in new home." class="wp-image-81952" srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/IMG_2498.jpg 1200w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/IMG_2498-350x525.jpg 350w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/IMG_2498-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/IMG_2498-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/IMG_2498-400x600.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/IMG_2498-150x225.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/IMG_2498.jpg"></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At first, we tried to make it work. But eventually, we realized something had to give. We started looking for a new place closer to the city, but nothing seemed to fit our budget or the neighborhoods we loved.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">So, we came up with a temporary solution. We rented a one-bedroom apartment for Dwight near his work. It solved the commute problem, but it also meant we were living apart most of the week. Since I work from home and use the house as my studio, we only saw each other on weekends.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">That setup came with its own set of challenges. Two homes meant double everything, i.e., two sets of bills, two internet accounts, and a lot of driving back and forth.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">After a year of juggling all of that, we knew we had to make a real change. We started searching again and, this time, we got lucky. We found a home right in the area we&rsquo;d been hoping for.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">If you know Atlanta, you know it&rsquo;s all about the neighborhoods. And for us, Decatur was always the dream. Finding a place there felt like everything just clicked into place.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We moved in mid-April, and we&rsquo;re finally back under one roof. The best part? Our old house is already under contract.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image aligncenter size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="893" data-pin-nopin="true" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Rockbridge.jpg" alt="Photos of our new home." class="wp-image-81953" srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Rockbridge.jpg 1200w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Rockbridge-350x260.jpg 350w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Rockbridge-768x572.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Rockbridge-400x298.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Rockbridge-150x112.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Rockbridge.jpg"></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The new house is brand new, and I fell in love with it the moment I saw the kitchen. It has a huge island that you&rsquo;ve probably noticed in <a href="https://www.youtube.com/foolproofliving" rel="nofollow">my recent YouTube videos</a>, and a beautiful deck that feels like a little escape.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">I&rsquo;m so grateful for how everything worked out. It feels good to be settled and starting this next chapter together.</p>
</div>



