<p class="wp-block-paragraph">As the daughter of a dentist, I&rsquo;ve always taken dental care seriously. I got the Suri toothbrush during last year&rsquo;s Black Friday sales and have been so happy with it. It&rsquo;s lightweight, has a long battery life, and comes with a case that also disinfects the brush. It&rsquo;s especially great for travel, and it leaves my teeth feeling so clean.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">If you&rsquo;re interested, the brand has given me a code to enter at checkout for 10% off. The code is AYSEGUL.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong><a href="https://rstyle.me/+wFw8YPRJEjk8KhyhlpGuSw" rel="sponsored nofollow">Gisou Honey Gloss Ceramide Therapy Hydrating Hair Mask</a></strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">I&rsquo;ve been using this instead of conditioner and love how my hair feels. I only wash my hair once or twice a week, and after a few uses, I noticed it felt fuller, softer, and shinier.</p>



